WEBVTT

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.350
O wandering spirit of Wonderland,

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:28.150
awaken from your slumber
and answer my voice.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.090
Who has disturbed my rest?

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.820
Have I been resurrected?

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.130
Yes, my Lord Madoushi.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:41.290
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:41.290
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:48.800
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:48.800
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:57.910
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:57.910
With our eyes on the future

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:04.010
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:04.010
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:13.650
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:13.650
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:21.160
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:21.160
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:26.870
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:26.870
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:36.370
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:36.370
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.290
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.400
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:59.800
Pist, one of the Four Lords of Gaudium,

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.400
has constructed a dimensional labyrinth
called the Ocean Puzzle.

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:07.140
Our lost travelers break through
the barriers one by one.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:20.520
When will they finally reach Teros,
the end of the sea of Wonderland?

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.410
I wonder if it will be all right to get off?

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.280
I'm sure it'll be fine. It can even hold Jane.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.610
Wait, it could be one of the enemy's traps.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:48.320
Chobi!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.250
He said it's fine.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.990
All right!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.660
Ai! Yu!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.500
It feels like a feather pillow!

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.310
Cotton candy!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.040
Oh, really.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.910
We can't move after all, can we?

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.750
Well, we are above the clouds.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:21.610
No...

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:27.390
We're in the cube, so I assume there is
some problem to solve.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.920
If we can clear it, then...

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.790
Take that!

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.010
This place doesn't seem dangerous
for the time being.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.070
Wait!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.270
Wait!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.010
Sis...

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.650
That's just weird!

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:21.580
Your Excellency, what kind of problem
are you preparing?

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.880
Would you be so kind as to tell me?

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:29.120
I don't know! Ask Oscha!

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.750
Ask Oscha?!

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:35.930
He wanted me to let him
handle the next problem.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.430
Oscha is always involved
in these secret matters.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:44.600
Why didn't he ask me?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:47.600
That was pretty sneaky of him to go
straight to His Excellency!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.110
I've got a bad feeling.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.210
Ai! Yu!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.920
Everyone, be careful!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.770
What? Something's come through!

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.740
Comodeen, prepare for battle!

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.410
Get everyone back into the submarine!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.620
One of the Earl's henchmen!

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:41.330
But doesn't something seem
a little different about him?

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.420
Yeah, he's all red.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.600
He carries with him a different
atmosphere than the last one who came.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.430
Didn't he just change clothes?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.860
Everyone, get away from that fog!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.760
It seems like we're being bound by the fog.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:27.260
My body won't move.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:31.040
Ai, Yu...

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.050
What's happening to us?

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.280
The red fog is a noxious gas.

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.180
I can't move!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.790
Kaze!

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:48.960
It has moved.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.440
Soil is my power!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.430
The Magun has thawed!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.960
So that is the Magun?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.450
By spinning the blades, it mobilizes the driller,

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.970
which is the key to the Soil system!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.040
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.450
The cry of a soul without light,
Dark Green!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.400
The one who forbids the birth of life,
Virgin White!

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.270
To freeze all things,
Ice Blue!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.060
Shine! I summon you, Shiva!

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:42.070
Amazing! So this is what the Magun can do?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:48.250
It converts the energy generated from the Soil
into an energy substance called a Summon.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:00.890
The Summon did nothing!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.660
Is this for real?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.330
He's so strong.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.190
I have no business with you.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.750
The real one's here!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.250
Another enemy when we're
in this weakened condition?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:02.220
We're done for.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.680
Cid, is there nothing you can do?

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:09.030
Even though my brain can work,
I can't move my body.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.660
So there's nothing...

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.130
Why?

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.230
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.360
Why have you...

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:22.730
I was resurrected to conclude my fight with you!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.180
Prepare for battle, my younger brother!

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.250
Brother...

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:56.310
Do you remember the great battle that
sealed the fate of our world?

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:37.520
At that time, why did I advance
towards the enemy,

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.890
fighting them without holding back?
Do you know?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.120
It was because you were a
swordsman of great pride.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.720
Wrong!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.060
I was thinking of you the entire time!

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.830
Me?

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:57.160
If it was you, what would you think?
What would you have done?

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.970
Those thoughts would always take me

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:03.930
to the question of who was the
stronger between the two of us.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.000
Brother...

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.970
I wanted to lead us to victory
in that great battle,

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:13.050
and show that my skills as a swordsman
were superior to yours.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:17.020
But I died.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:22.920
However, even in death, I could not
free myself from this emotion.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.360
So that is how badly you've wanted to fight me.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:31.240
Our world has been swallowed up
and destroyed by Chaos.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:33.640
I am now free of other concerns.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:40.040
I knew it! These guys have had their
worlds swallowed up by Chaos too.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.940
So does that mean that Kaze's world too...

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.420
Now, come fight with me!

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:51.820
Brother!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.250
Now I am nothing more than a dead spirit
dwelling in this sword.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:58.930
Answer my spirit and my sword!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.410
What do you think, Your Excellency?

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.010
I can feel Chaos with all of my body.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.950
That is great to know.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:18.010
Oscha baby, you're such a bad little boy.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.650
I knew that we needed Makenshi.

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:25.860
If you will not come to me, I will come for you!

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.590
Brother!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:09.130
Brother, don't you realize that someone is taking
advantage of your heart, trying to confuse you?

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:14.070
What of it?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.670
Brother...

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.580
Try taking this on! My Flare Sword!

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:46.030
Enveloped in a beautiful song...

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.300
Now sleep! Pure Red Requiem!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.690
Pure White Requiem!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.950
What incredible energy of Chaos!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:40.590
But if they keep this up,
my Ocean Puzzle will collapse!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.920
Why?

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:12.790
When did...

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:22.460
At that time...

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.140
Please calm your spirit.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:34.710
Why not see if your sword can calm my spirit?!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:41.290
My brother, you've lost the power
that made you Madoushi.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.410
Now the sword of my spirit
should work against you.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.640
<i>What an amazing sword!</i>

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:14.280
<i>I see. That sword was made to
cut down the true enemy.</i>

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.520
<i>My little brother...</i>

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:20.090
<i>You must succeed where I could not.</i>

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.350
<i>I'm counting on you.</i>

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.570
Brother...

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:48.920
Hey, I can move.

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:50.720
Makenshi...

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.060
Are you all right? Can you stand?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.290
Yeah!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.360
Those guys...

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.330
Everyone! Get back to the submarine!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:26.120
Stop it! You mustn't fight!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:34.630
If any more energy is released, my
Ocean Puzzle won't be able to take it!

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.240
Pretty fragile, isn't it?

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.040
I appreciate your comment, Your Excellency,

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.940
but I'm afraid that you are mistaken.

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.470
The energy released from Makenshi's
fight with an equal warrior

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:49.170
would be even greater than the energy
needed to destroy the world!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:54.450
If you had seen fit to inform me
about this beforehand, then...

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.550
I got it, I got it.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.120
So what are we going to do, Oscha?

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.800
I believe it would be best
not to allow Lord Makenshi

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:07.500
to battle the Black Wind
at this time, Your Excellency.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.960
Yeah, I'm full for today anyway.

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.830
Go ahead, you can move them to the
next stage of the Ocean Puzzle.

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.140
What?!

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.200
We're shaking!

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:24.970
Chaos...

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

